          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "code": {
          "text": "Faecal incontinence in the context of known ulcerative colitis; likely multifactorial, with loose stool and urgency and probable mild sphincter/pelvic floor weakness"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Condition/condition-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Condition",
        "id": "condition-2",
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "code": {
          "text": "Ulcerative colitis, reported by patient; current activity uncertain, possibly mild versus functional overlay; extent and severity uncertain"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Condition/condition-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Condition",
        "id": "condition-3",
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "code": {
          "text": "Significant health anxiety with reassurance seeking and catastrophising around cancer and stoma; longstanding pattern by history, no formal diagnosis reported"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-1",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-1",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Bowel symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Six to eight months of faecal incontinence, worse over the last 2–3 weeks; loose stools 3–5 times daily, mostly non-bloody with possible mucus; urgency with small-volume leakage 2–3 times weekly, sometimes unable to reach the toilet; occasional later seepage and underwear soiling after a bowel movement."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Nocturnal diarrhoea"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No diarrhoea waking the patient at night; sometimes gets up pre-emptively because of concern about needing the toilet."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported associated symptoms and red-flag screen"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies weight loss, fevers, night sweats, PR bleeding, melaena, severe abdominal pain, nausea, vomiting, and reduced appetite. Reports no recent antibiotics, travel, or sick contacts."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported neurological and urinary red-flag symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies urinary incontinence, saddle anaesthesia, leg weakness, and back trauma."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Bowel symptom impact and anxiety"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Very increased health anxiety with extensive online searching and worry about cancer, stoma, and insides wearing out. Embarrassed by accidents at work, keeps spare underwear and pads, avoids longer trips, and changes playground-duty arrangements when possible."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Patient-reported possible symptom triggers"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient thinks symptoms may have worsened since increasing almond milk and kombucha for gut health. Recently started using a standing desk at work; reassured this was unlikely to cause structural damage."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
